        "like": 10
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Most people here seem to only think \"oh, it's just social game\" and such, but considering how Udon is being pushed more and more, have you thought about other actions in VRChat than staring at the mirror?\nMany games that world makers do are pretty awkward to play when connecting outside of NA. One of good examples is recently published Freeze Tag world. It's a wonderful world and great fun, but it gives EU folks many issues. Freezing players is EXTREMELY delayed so players can abuse this by saving few people while you can't do anything but hope that the server catches up with the fact that he should be already frozen. I'm not saying that NA people might have zero delays and such, but 250 ping is NOT helping at all. \nIf you are going to introduce Udon to us with all these cool concepts and games you can do, please let us at least host it ourselves. It doesn't make any sense for an instance filled with EU boys to be stuck in NA servers.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
